@SkillHub_Host = http://localhost:5180
@Api = {{SkillHub_Host}}/api/v1

### 1. Health Check
GET {{SkillHub_Host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Scalar Documentation
GET {{SkillHub_Host}}/scalar

### 3. Registro de Participante (Público)
POST {{Api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Juan Perez",
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "password": "Participant123!"
}

### 4. Login Participante (Obtiene JWT)
# @name loginParticipant
POST {{Api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "password": "Participant123!"
}

### 5. Login Empleado / Instructor (Obtiene JWT)
# @name loginEmployee
POST {{Api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@skillhub.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Guardar Token de Empleado
@employeeToken = {{loginEmployee.response.body.token}}
@participantToken = {{loginParticipant.response.body.token}}

### 6. Catálogo de Talleres Futuros con Cupos Disponibles (Público)
GET {{Api}}/workshops
Accept: application/json

### 7. Detalle de un Taller con Cupos Disponibles (Público)
# Reemplazar {workshopId} por el ID obtenido del catálogo
GET {{Api}}/workshops/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 8. Crear Taller (Solo Empleado)
POST {{Api}}/workshops
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "FOT-002",
  "title": "Fotografía Nocturna y Larga Exposición",
  "description": "Taller práctico sobre técnicas de exposición en condiciones de baja luminosidad.",
  "instructorEmail": "carlos.mendoza@skillhub.com",
  "startDate": "2026-11-20T19:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-11-20T22:00:00Z",
  "maxCapacity": 10
}

### 9. Inscribirse en un Taller (Participante Autenticado)
POST {{Api}}/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{participantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workshopId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 10. Mis Inscripciones (Participante Autenticado)
GET {{Api}}/enrollments/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{participantToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Lista de Inscritos de un Taller (Solo Empleado)
GET {{Api}}/workshops/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Cancelar Inscripción (Dueño o Empleado)
PATCH {{Api}}/enrollments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{participantToken}}

### 13. Descargar Constancia de Inscripción en PDF (Dueño o Empleado)
GET {{Api}}/enrollments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/certificate
Authorization: Bearer {{participantToken}}

### 14. Reporte de Talleres con Más Inscritos (Solo Empleado)
GET {{Api}}/reports/top-workshops
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Accept: application/json
